OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 200 people object to
OL,4,Asupermarket plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 200 people have objected to
OL,7,Freplacing a row of shops with a Tesco
OL,8,Fsupermarket.
OL,10,FWest Midlands-based LCP Property
OL,11,FInvestments said opening a Tesco
OL,12,FExpress in Lakes Parade in Hawcoat,
OL,13,FBarrow, would "generate additional
OL,14,Femployment opportunities for local
OL,15,Fpeople".
OL,17,FFour businesses were given eviction
OL,18,Fnotices in 2025 after plans were
OL,19,Fsubmitted for the supermarket to be
OL,20,Fbuilt where six units currently stand.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
