OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 200 people object to
OL,4,Asupermarket plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 209 signed letters sent to
OL,7,FWestmorland and Furness Council,
OL,8,Fresidents said the application
OL,9,F"threatens to remove an accessible,
OL,10,Fvalued and sustainable cluster of
OL,11,Fcommunity-serving businesses".
